Hide All No-pause.
Disp '{1}'              At Row 01 Col 01
     '{2}'              At Row 02 Col 01 With Size {&FrameSize} Font 3 No-box Frame fErr{1}.
Bell.
DO ON ENDKEY UNDO,RETRY:
    DO WHILE LASTKEY <> -1: 
        &IF DEFINED(ErrorDisplaySeconds) = 0 
        &THEN
           READKEY.
           IF LASTKEY <> 27 THEN   /* sai com qualquer tecla, com exce‡Æo da tecla "ESC" */
              LEAVE.
        &ELSE
           READKEY PAUSE {&ErrorDisplaySeconds}. 
           IF LASTKEY <> 27 THEN   /* sai com qualquer tecla, com exce‡Æo da tecla "ESC" */
              LEAVE.                  
        &ENDIF                              
    END.
    Hide Frame _Error.
END.
If Session:data-entry-return = Yes Then.
